window.products.push({"id":246098,"name":"Set of 4 Pumpkin Throw Pillow Covers 18x18 Fall Pillow Covers Home Decor, Fall Throw Pillowcase for Thanksgiving Halloween Decor, Outdoor Pillow Cover","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71L27uKTS3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Short Plush 🍂【Premium Quality】 This fall pillow covers 18x18 is made of high quality short velvet, the short velvet is very soft and delicate to the touch, and printed using the advanced digital printing technology, with rich details, clear picture quality, breathable and skin-friendly, not easy to wrinkle, suitable for people with allergies to plush or those with respiratory system diseases. 🍂【Unique Design】 These thanksgiving pillow covers 18x18 are designed with invisible zippers, delicate stitching is durable and printed with rich and delicate unique pumpkin, which is full of thanksgiving atmosphere. Wide opening design makes it easy to insert fillers. (NOTICE: Pattern Printed only one side!) 🍂【Perfect Size】 The size of fall pillow covers is 18x18 inch/ 45cm x 45cm, fit for most sizes of pillows (Inserts are Not Included). The thanksgiving pillow covers bringing different styles and fashions with pastel colors and elegant pattern designs, bring you closer to nature, appreciate the beauty of art. 🍂【Widely Application】 These autumn pillow covers 18x18 can add a sense of design to your home decoration, also create a cozy atmosphere. Suitable for the bedroom, garden, living room, classroom, farmhouses, office, car, cafe shops, patio, bars and adding an elegant look to any space. 🍂【Perfect Gift for Thanksgiving】 You can give these soft fall pillow covers 18x18 as a thoughtful gift for an upcoming holiday or housewarming present. Add a touch of autumn to the bedroom and living room. Machine washable on mild mode, or hand wash in cold water. Tumble dry on low heat, do not bleach or iron, it will look new after washing. 🍂【Order Tips】 Blurred printing is an oil painting style, not a flaw. Please confirm before purchasing. thanks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71L27uKTS3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHengQiSM","source_asin":"B0BCPH267G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-246098","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCPH267G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCPH267G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":246099,"name":"Isaac Jacobs 4x6, Antique Gold, Vintage Style Brass and Glass, Metal Floating Picture Frame (Vertical) with Locket Closure, for Photos, Art, & More, T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Vm+Og2DqL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"VINTAGE APPEAL: This Isaac Jacobs Brass and Glass floating frame has a stunning vintage appeal that really catches the eye. The frame’s antique feel breathes life into photos and precious thin keepsakes. The antique-inspired design of a sliding locket closure is a beautiful touch that easily lets you place photographs in between the pressed-glass surface and thin frame edges. This elegant frame is ideal for displaying the precious moments in life, like birthdays and baby showers. HOME DISPLAY: The timeless allure of this contemporary floating frame will draw attention to the beautiful photos displayed within the frame. This frame’s antique look will stand out wherever you place it in the home. Your favorite snapshots, cityscape shots, and architectural photos will be on stylish display in these gorgeous frames that elevate the look of any shelf, desk, windowsill, or mantlepiece in the home and will add variety and excitement to any room. MULTI-FUNCTIONAL: Pressed flowers and thin mementos can be displayed like art inside the wide-open glass surface. Illustrations, drawings, and fun photobooth snaps will stand out inside the pressed glass. The frame is a beautiful choice for a wedding centerpiece. To create the chic “floating” effect, simply use a small piece of tape to secure a smaller photo to the inner glass pane. [NOTES: (1) THIS FRAME DOES NOT STAND HORIZONTALLY (2) THIS FRAME CAN NOT BE MOUNTED ON A WALL] EASY TO USE: This vintage-looking photo frame has a delicate, yet elegant easel and will rest securely on any tabletop. This frame’s simple style and functional design make it a perfect frame to use for special events. This attractive locket closure has a sophisticated appeal and it is easy to use when inserting photos. Gently slide up the bar to raise the clasp and separate the panes. Slide down to securely close. GREAT FOR GIFTS: This beautiful brass and glass frame is a smart choice for use as a display frame for hotels, restaurants, and retail store countertops. This high-quality frame makes a lovely house-warming gift. Spread joy with these gorgeous frames by giving them to your co-workers, friends, and family throughout the year. The frame is available in multiple sizes and colors. (Antique Bronze, Antique Gold, Black, and White) Get more of the frame you love with our multi-pack offers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Vm+Og2DqL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Isaac Jacobs International","source_asin":"B08746HM8S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-246099","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08746HM8S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08746HM8S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
