window.products.push({"id":246236,"name":"JoFomp Digital Alarm Clock for Bedroom - Large 13 Inch LED Display, Remote Control, Automatic Brightness, Daylight Saving Time, Temperature, Timer, Da","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618bqNZvOLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"◑MULTI-FUNCTION 13” DIGITAL LED WALL CLOCK---This digital LED wall clock has a large display screen with eye-catching LED digits that provide clear and comfortable visibility. You can easily read the time, no matter the time of day or night. It also has six modes: clock, date, week, temperature, alarm, and countdown timer. It's perfect for cooking in the kitchen, getting ready for the day, working out, teaching a class, and helping kids manage their time. ◑AUTO/CUSTOM BRIGHTNESS DIMMER---This digital wall clock has a display with 10 levels of adjustable brightness. You can easily adjust it to your preferred level using the remote control. Plus, it has a built-in light sensor that automatically adjusts the brightness based on the ambient light in the room. ◑PLUG-IN POWERED + BATTERY FOR TIME MEMORY---This digital wall clock has a built-in memory function that keeps the time data safe even if the power is disconnected. You don't need to reset it when the power comes back on. You'll need to supply your own power adapter (not included) and use the included 5V DC power cord to make the clock work. The clock also has a backup battery (not included) that stores the clock settings in case of a power outage. Please note: The screen will go blank when the backup battery is in use. ◑WIRELESS REMOTE CONTROL + DUAL ALARM CLOCK + AUTO DST---This digital wall clock is easy for anyone to use, thanks to the convenient remote control. You don't have to remove the clock from the wall to change the settings. The large digital display is easy to read for people of all ages. Plus, you can set two separate alarms if you have different schedules. And, when you turn on daylight saving time (DST), the clock will automatically adjust to the correct time in spring and fall. ◑SIMPLE MODERN STYLE---This practical digital clock with a large display and date and day of the week features is suitable for use in a variety of settings, including as a wall clock, desk clock, digital calendar, and countdown timer. It's perfect for decorating your living room, bathroom, bedroom, kitchen, garage, office, classroom, gym, store, kindergarten, warehouse, bar, and more. It's also a great gift for kids, friends, partners, and the elderly. ◑SATISFACTORY SERVICE---If you have any issues with this clock, please don't hesitate to contact us. JoFomp offers a 12-month hassle-free warranty. Add it to your cart now with our risk-free protection. We believe in and always insist on providing high-quality products and satisfactory customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618bqNZvOLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JoFomp","source_asin":"B0BRD3FXHD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-246236","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRD3FXHD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRD3FXHD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
