window.products.push({"id":246259,"name":"OKPAL 32 x 24 Inch LED Bathroom Mirror with Lights, Large Wall Mounted Anti-Fog Dimmable Makeup Lighted Mirror Vanity, White/Neutral/Warm Light, Memor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":159.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fhWocMCOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🏠【Dimmable & Memory】 This led mirror for bathroom is multifunctional. You can press the button to change the color temperatures: Warm(3000K), natural (4000K) and white(6000K). Long press to adjust the brightness of the light from 0% to100%. All these will be easily controlled by the touch button. The smart memory function will record the lighting setting and keep the previous lighting status after turning off and on. 🏠【Anit-fog LED Bathroom Mirror】 Anit-fog led mirror for bathroom prevents condensation building up on the mirror, so no matter how hot you have your bath or shower, you’ll always step out to a completely clear bathroom mirror with lights. There is a heating pad behind the backlit vanity mirror which heats the surface of the mirror, there fore preventing any condensation from forming. 🏠【Shatterproof & Corrosion Proof】 LED mirror for bathroom is designed with 5MM tempered glass, Sturdy & durable. A clear reflection and no distortion, Waterproof. Even vanity mirror with lights is broken, it will not shatter to piece, no harm, more safe to use. led bathroom mirror is corrosion proof with epoxy coat. A fashion modern LED vanity mirror adds luxury to your bathroom. 🏠【Simple Installation & Powered by Plug-in/Hardwired】 With 2 wall brackets, 4 screws, 4 Plastic Anchors. Mount the 2 wall brackets on the wall and hang the bathroom mirror with lights on the brackets. The Led bathroom mirror can be hardwired or plugged in. It is better done by a professional electrician if you want to hardwire it. 🏠【Press Add to Cart with Confidence】 We will provide 3 years warranty for OKPAL bathroom mirror with lights. For any doubts and questions, please feel free to contact us. We welcome all the recommendations for any improvement of vanity led mirror. Our Mission is to produce the beautiful, modern, safe mirror for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fhWocMCOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OKPAL","source_asin":"B0BN56JPVY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-246259","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN56JPVY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN56JPVY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
