window.products.push({"id":246322,"name":"KES Hand Towel Stand for Bathroom Countertop Double-T Towel Holder Towel Rack with Square Base SUS304 Stainless Steel Brushed Finish, BTH209B-2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71N7D6Y9tzL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"Upgraded Rustproof Design: The upgraded base is made of materials that protect the unit against rust and corrosion making it ideal for humid environments like the bathroom. KES has also increased the weight of the base to 3.3 lbs (1.5kg) to keep it from tipping over, which is 1.5lbs (87.5%) heavier than other similar items on the market. TWO-TIER DESIGN: The smartly designed double-T towel stand is great for displaying and drying up to two towels. The vertical hanging space of the upper arm is 15.7 inches（400mm）, suitable for hanging hand towel (Maximum Length: 31\") or fingertip towel. The vertical hanging space of the lower arm is 11.3 inches (286mms) , ideal for hanging fingertip towel (Maximum Length: 22\") or dishcloth. ANTI-SLIP EDGE: Different from the others, this hand towel stand is uniquely designed with the protruded edge at both ends of the bars, effectively preventing the fingertip towels from slipping off. Besides, with the smooth edge, you don't need to worry about the fingertip towels being ripped anymore. ANTI-SLIP PADDING: This counter top towel stand comes with five circular paddings, you can stick them at the bottom of the base to prevent towel rack from moving out of place. Moreover, padded bottom can keep your table free from scratches. RUSTPROOF: The T-shape arms and the base plate are constructed of SUS304 premium grade stainless steel and added with 18/8 Chromium/Nickel content, protecting against corrosion & rust. Moreover, the metal base is processed by the color finish. Suitable for humid environments such as the bathroom and kitchen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71N7D6Y9tzL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KES","source_asin":"B0895W687P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-246322","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0895W687P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0895W687P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
