window.products.push({"id":246452,"name":"Safstar 1300 Watt Electric Meat Grinder Professional Commercial Home Food Mincer Meat Grind Steel with 3 Grinding Plates (2 Packs)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617ghDF92ZL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Important Notice 1: Pressing switch from \"on\" to \"R\" or from \"R\" to \"on\" after operating more than 30 seconds, or it may caused spark or electric shocks. 2: Please do not put meat into the grinder before you turn the grinder on, or it may caused current impulse by jamming. 3: Do not force to operate the grinder with excessive pressure, or it will caused jamming too. 4: Unplug when assembling or disassembling the unit. 5: Do not fix the cutting blade/cutting plate when using kibble attachment. 6: Never push meat by hand. 7: Do not grind with bones, nuts or any other tough food. 8: Continuous running the meat grinder not more than 10 minutes, it can be run again after motor has been cooled. 9: When the circuit breaker activates, do not turn switch on. 10: Never near by children. 11: Never operate the unit if the cord or plug is damaged. 12: Home use only 13.Please kindly know that this meat grinder does not support dishwasher! Specifications: Voltage: 110V/60Hz Power Consumed:1300W Material: Stainless Steel Size:12.5\"x4.5\"x12\" Weight: 8.58lbs/3.9kg Package Includes: 1 x Meat Grinder Electric 3 x stainless steel grinding plates 1 x 100% 304 Grade Stainless Steel Cutting Blades 1 x Kubbe attachment 1 x Owners manual Tips for using: 1:Every cutting accessories (detachable tube, screw and stainless steel cutting blade) will have protective oil, please set up to grind without meet for about 5 minutes 2:Detaching to rinse with water 3:set up again for normal use 4:please do remember make the cutting blade toward the outside","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617ghDF92ZL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"S AFSTAR","source_asin":"B01LX646TP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-246452","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LX646TP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LX646TP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":246453,"name":"Silicone Molds [Rose, 6 Cup] Cupcake Baking Pan - Free Paper Muffin Cups - Non Stick, BPA Free, 100% Silicon & Dishwasher Safe Silicon Bakeware Tin - ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hkldirQwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Create your own special desserts or homemade soaps with the Freshware SL-135RD 6-Cavity Silicone Rose Muffin, Cupcake, Brownie, Cornbread, Cheesecake, Panna Cotta, Pudding, Jello Shot and Soap Mold. This mold is constructed with 100% pure, professional quality food-grade silicone, which meets US FDA and European LFGB safety standards (BPA, PVC and Phthalate FREE). Simply pour your favorite recipe in the mold, prepare, and cool completely. Then turn it upside down, this flexible silicone mold offers a non-stick surface that allows the baked goods to pop right out with a little push from the bottom. Remember to place the silicone mold on a baking sheet for easier positioning and removal. Mold Size: 11.7 x 6.8 x 1.4 inch. Cavity Size: 2.8 inch diameter x 1.4 inch depth. Volume: 6 x 4.5 oz, Total 27 oz. Many customers have found creative ways to use Freshware silicone molds (depending upon the shape) to create delicious homemade cupcakes, muffins, brownies, cookies, cheesecakes, quiches, breads, chocolates, candies, tarts, butters, caramels, ice cubes, frozen baby foods, gelatin, ice creams etc. Other customers use the molds in unique ways to create clays, resin casting, candles, soaps and more. All Freshware silicone products DO NOT have Chemical Coatings and are Pinch Test Passed. Our silicone mold handles temperature from -40 to +446 degrees Fahrenheit (-40 to +230 degrees Celsius). Reusable for up to 3,000 uses, our molds save money by eliminating the need to ever buy disposable paper liners again. Safe to use in the Oven, Refrigerator, Freezer, Microwave, Steamer and Dishwasher. Top rack dishwasher safe, but hand washing is recommended to extend the life of the product. What Is A Pinch Test? Cheaper brands often use plastic fillers in their silicone products, so it is not safe for high-temperature baking. Pinch and twist a bit of the silicone, if it turns white, it’s got fillers as 100% pure silicone will retain its color.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hkldirQwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Freshware","source_asin":"B088QRK5WQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-246453","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088QRK5WQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088QRK5WQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
