window.products.push({"id":246500,"name":"PURE BAMBOO Full Bamboo Mattress Protector - Waterproof Breathable Cooling Cover Protects Against Moisture, Spills, Stains - Noiseless, Machine Washab","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Xo3sFwPyS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COMPLETE WATERPROOF MATTRESS PROTECTION: Accidents happen! Don't let a midnight mishap or sickness side-effect ruin your day... or your sleep schedule. Keep your mattress fully protected from moisture, damp conditions, wetness, spills, sweat, night time accidents and stains with this waterproof cover from Pure Bamboo. Carefully designed to meet the needs of toddlers, children, adults, the elderly, the incontinent with sizes available for the whole family! NOISELESS, BREATHABLE, COOLING COMFORT: Experience deep, restful sleep in ultimate cool comfort. The soft, breathable jacquard material is soothing and cooling against skin, wicking away moisture while circulating air to prevent hot spots. There's nothing more disruptive to sleep than the crinkling of a plastic or vinyl liners. Our protective liner is 100% noiseless and discreet, maintaining silence during sleep and preserving the dignity of elderly & medically impaired individuals. 16 INCH DEEP POCKETS FOR SNUG FIT & EASY APPLICATION: With the convenient design of this mattress cover, you won't have to spend an extra second struggling to put it on the bed! Deep (16\") pockets and an elasticized skirt that features 75 GSM one-way knitting make for effortless ease of application. Enjoy a perfect snug fit that won't shift, slide, or most importantly, affect the feel of the bed you love. SOFT BAMBOO BLEND: Not all mattress covers and sheet protectors are created equal. This luxurious waterproof mattress protector is made of liquid-repelling 60/40 polyester and bamboo fibers. Luxuriously plush and soft at 300 GSM, it enhances your comfort with its buoyancy and breathability. A 75 GSM skirt with generous corner pockets stretches over your mattress for easy installation and non-slip fit. Imported. Machine washable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Xo3sFwPyS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pure Bamboo","source_asin":"B098KTBTX3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-246500","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098KTBTX3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098KTBTX3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
