window.products.push({"id":246552,"name":"Martha Stewart Lockton Premium Nonstick PFA Free Ceramic Interior 10 Piece Heavy Gauge Enamel Aluminum Pots and Pans Cookware Set - Linen White w/Gold","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":179.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Eb19RYAXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Lockton 10-piece Aluminum Ceramic Nonstick Cookware Set from Martha Stewart is a contemporary suite of pots and pans accented with gold-colored stainless steel handles for a stylish cooking experience and presentation. Crafted from heavy-gauge aluminum, this impressive cookware heats and cooks evenly to whip up dishes with amazing flavors any time of the day. This collection beams with elegance inside out with a glossy enamel exterior to resist stains and a beauitful ceramic nonstick interior - made without PFOA and PTFE - to allow less oil and fat needed for easy food release and cleanup. Each pot and pan features riveted, gilded handles to offer a safe grip that is strong as it is luxurious. Vented, tempered glass lids complement each of the four pots perfectly as they seal in heat and moisture, bringing out the best, natural flavors while cooking. Built for style and function, this collection is safe to use on gas, electric, ceramic, and halogen stovetops. The pots and pans are oven safe up to 480°F, while the glass lids are safe up to 350°F. Dishwasher safe, hand wash recommended.  Embrace thoughtfully designed home essentials from America’s most trusted lifestyle expert, Martha Stewart. Step into her exquisite and iconic world filled with a curation of high-quality products to prep, cook, bake, serve, and enjoy. All crafted to elevate everyday homemaking and seasonal entertaining, these kitchen and tabletop pieces blend style and performance, inspiring avid hosts and home cooks to set stylish tables, serve up delicious meals, and create spectacular memories.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Eb19RYAXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MARTHA STEWART","source_asin":"B0BS4V9L4G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-246552","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BS4V9L4G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BS4V9L4G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
