window.products.push({"id":246562,"name":"Airtight Food Storage Container - Cereal & Dry Food Storage Containers Set of 8, Leak Proof & BPA Free, with 4 Measuring Cups and 16 Labels & 1 Chalk ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jYq0oZVFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cereal box Get SODPE Cereal Containers to Make Your Pantry and Cabinet Organized! Looking for some cereal storage container to preserve your cereal and maximize its life? These are for you! They keep rats, ants and insects out. They keep your cereal dry, and ready to use. They ensure your frequently used cereals are within a reach. They help to keep your cabinet/pantry organized. They lock the contents inside and protect them from spilling. Package Included 2 Large cereal containers:  5.2L/ 175.9 fl.oz 4 Medium cereal containers: 2.5L / 85 fl.oz 4 Small cereal containers: 1.8L/61oz 4 Pcs measuring spoons 16 Pcs  Reusable Chalkboard Labels 1 White marker Food-grade Plastic & BPA Free Made from food-grade, BPA free plastic,SODPE cereal storage containers are sturdy enough not to break under normal use and care. It is durable, lightweight, and easy to maintain and would be a great addition to your kitchen. Tight-sealing Lids 4-sided locking lid with a silicone seal which can prevent moisture from entering the container that can facilitate the staleness process. It can also help keep out pests like pantry moths and household dust. Great Space Saver The stackable design makes the cereal containers a space saver. If you have limited pantry space, then the cereal containers would be a great solution. They are easy to organize and store without taking up unnecessary space and you will wonder how you went without them for so long. See-through Design Transparent cereal containers make it easy to find what you need without opening the container. No more guessing if you’re going to open an empty box of cereal and you’ll know right away when content is low and to refill","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jYq0oZVFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SODPE","source_asin":"B08FZWZFBC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-246562","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FZWZFBC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FZWZFBC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
