window.products.push({"id":246566,"name":"AYOTEE Silicone Ice Cube Tray with Lid and Bin, 64 Nugget Ice Bin Small Ice Cube Trays for Freezer with Lid, Come with 2 Silicone Ice Trays, Drawer Ty","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KvTK0XjkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【DRAWER TYPE ICE CUBE BIN FOR FREEZER】The ice molds with unique pull-out drawer design. When you use a regular silicone ice tray with lid and bin, you need to move the stackable ice cube trays and open the lid. With our drawer ice cube molds & trays, you only need to pull out the bottom drawer to access the contents without removing the top stackable ice trays. It also effectively prevents odors in the refrigerator. 【FOOD-GRADE SILICONE ICE CUBE MOLDS】The ice cube tray with bin is made of food-grade silicone and PP material. You'll receive 2 silicone ice cube trays with lids. The dimensions are 8.8 x 4.8 x 1.1 inches. Each tray makes 24 nice-sized cubes for a total of 48. This ice tray with storage bin takes up little space and fits nicely in small freezers. Great for RVs, home use and parties. 【EASY ICE RELEASE】The all silicone ice cube trays, which makes it easy to release and the soft silicone material will not break even after freezing for a long time. Each cube compartment is separate from others so you can easily push from the bottom. But do not fill the water level higher than 3mm below the edge, otherwise everything will freeze together and be hard to release. Please place for 30 seconds at room temperature before taking out the ice cube, then it will be easier to release. 【STACKABLE AND SPACE-SAVING】Each ice cube maker set comes with two silicone ice trays for freezer with lid, one drawer container and scoop. Our ice bin for freezer with lid keeps ice fresh and sanitary by preventing it absorbing freezer odors. Multiple covered ice cube trays can also be stacked, making it easier to store in the refrigerator and helping you save freezer space. Easy to clean. NOTE: DISHWASHER SAFE ONLY FOR THE SILICONE TRAY. 【MULTI-PURPOSE ICE MAKER FOR FREEZER】Ideal for cocktails, whiskey, coffee, smoothie, juice or lemonade. Besides water, you can fill the ice cube trays silicone with fruits, soda, cocktail, whisky, vodka, ice coffee or wine to customize your favorite flavor. Then you can release the ice cubes into the drawer storage container to help you more convenient to take ice from the fridge. Please keep the drawer parallel with the bin when pulling to avoid getting stuck.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KvTK0XjkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AYOTEE","source_asin":"B0BYHKY1X6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-246566","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYHKY1X6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYHKY1X6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
