window.products.push({"id":246595,"name":"Yair Emanuel Hanukah Menorah Strip of Colored Pomegranate Candle Holders Designed by Artist (Red)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":91.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dAAnskuzL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"This red-hued, sophisticated Menorah is made in a simple, yet sleek line style with pomegranate candle holders rising above. The candle holders appear in a row with the Shamash raised in the center.The Menorah is a symbol of wisdom and an ancient symbol of Israel. Uses standard Chanukah candles. About the Artist: In his Studio, located in Jerusalem, Emanuel designs various Judaica products. The designs are based upon a fusion of traditional motifs and ancient Jewish manuscripts with modern and oriental art. Vivid and harmonious colors as well as a mixture of the old and the new, characterize Emanuel's work. The artist, Yair Emanuel, designs and crafts in many different techniques. Among his techniques are hand embroidery, painting on wood, painting on silk and a variety of metal designs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dAAnskuzL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yair Emanuel","source_asin":"B07CRYJCKV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-246595","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CRYJCKV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CRYJCKV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":246596,"name":"Handmade Katori Indian Dishes - Set of 8 Copper Bowls - Traditional Indian Dinner Plates & Indian Cooking Utensils - Unique Copper Gifts","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MBJzbxAnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dinner isn't ready to delight your guests until it's plated with the right dinnerware, and our Handmade Katori Indian Dishes are the perfect way to serve a wide variety of dishes. These Indian dinner plates are artisan crafted by skilled craftsmen using the very same metalworking techniques that have been used to produce Indian cooking utensils and tableware for generations. The katori Indian dishes are produced one at a time employing the highest possible quality standards to make the servingware the absolute best copper bowls you'll find on Amazon! Katori are traditional Indian dinner plates that are used for serving daal, curries and biryani. Not just for Indian cuisine, the copper bowls are perfect for plating any meal that includes noodles or rice with a vegetable or meat topping. The shape of the 3.25-inch by 1.5-inch round bowls makes it easy to get bites of the rice or noodle along with the toppings, and each of the four included in this set holds 150 milliliters of food, enough for a perfect healthy portion. Our Handmade Katori Indian Dishes are uniquely designed with both form and function in mind. Outside, the copper bowls please the eye with a hammered finish that reflects the light and gives the metal an attractive shiny quality. Inside, the Indian dinner plates are lined with stainless steel. This ultra durable metal is nonreactive, so it won't alter the taste of the dishes presented in the copper bowls nor will it be damaged by the acids in tomatoes and other foods. If you're looking for traditional 7th anniversary gifts, you can't go wrong with our Handmade Katori Indian Dishes. These copper gifts are sure to delight any home gourmet. Serve up Indian delicacies and noodle and rice dishes with traditional Indian dinner plates that will earn rave reviews from your guests or buy the perfect copper gifts to make someone's 7th wedding anniversary extra special. Order this set of Handmade Katori Indian Dishes today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MBJzbxAnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shalinindia","source_asin":"B00IS2QQI2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-246596","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00IS2QQI2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00IS2QQI2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
