window.products.push({"id":246696,"name":"cmjxfz Reusable Pink Kitty's Tote Canvas Bag For Women Cute Aesthetic Shopping Bag/Gym Bag/Lunch Bag Gifts, Medium","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/411FtIQHiVL._AC_UL1074_.jpg","description":"No-Lining SPECIFICATIONS:Reusable Cute Kitty's Tote Canvas Bag,you can comfortably carry by hand or over your shoulder. Size:15’'x11.8''x5.5’’. Suitable for boys and girls over 14 or adult girls.MULTI-PURPOSE:This great canvas tote bag can also be used as a grocery shopping bag, beach bag, gift bag, eco-friendly bag! ENVIRONMENTAL:Not plastic,Not disposable supplies,non - toxic,smell no pungent.canvas tote bags can be reused, very environmentally friendly, cost-effective.It's the wisest choice. Canvas fabric knowledge introduction Canvas fabric is actually a fabric made of cotton or cotton polyester with special craftsmanship. Generally divided into the following four types: 1.Cotton printed canvas, pure cotton canvas, as the name suggests, is 100% cotton fabric. The advantages of cotton fabric are strong hygroscopicity, good dyeing performance, soft hand feeling, comfortable wearing, simple appearance, not easy to be moth-eaten, firm and durable ; The disadvantage is that the quick-drying performance is poor. Cotton printed canvas is the best choice for luggage fabrics. It is fashionable and beautiful, and it is at the forefront of fashion. It can also be used as shoe material—printed canvas shoes. It is fresh and fashionable, and it is also used in some products that require slightly higher strength. 2. Polyester-cotton printed canvas contains two components, polyester and cotton. As for its specific composition ratio, there is no regulation. As long as its composition meets the conditions, it can be named after it; polyester-cotton canvas is based on cotton canvas. Developed, adding polyester ingredients, so the fabric strength will increase, especially in terms of wear resistance. 3. The printed canvas is generally 60 cotton: 40 polyester. This type of fabric is generally used for luggage fabrics, tablecloths, tablecloths, curtains, and others. Its advantage is that it is durable. 4. Polyester printed canvas, polyester canvas is all-polyester canvas, some all-polyester canvas may be more expensive than all-cotton canvas, polyester canvas has high strength, good elasticity, good impact resistance, corrosion resistance, moth resistance, heat resistance, light resistance Good performance, 1000 hours of exposure to the sun, the strength remains 60-70%, but the hygroscopicity is very poor. Polyester printed canvas is generally used as handbags, cosmetic bags, curtains, kitchen and bathroom supplies, etc. WARM TIPS:Washable and durable. Washing instructions ①Hand wash in cold water, machine washable. ②The detergent should be fully dissolved in water and put into a bag. Do not pour detergent directly onto the bag (bleaching ingredients in detergent can cause localized discoloration of the bag). ③ Be sure to rinse off the detergent, and put it in a cool place to dry after rinsing. ④Do not expose to the sun, it will partially fade, do not wring dry, the bag will wrinkle ⑤ The bag will shrink and wrinkle after washing. If you mind, you can iron it after drying.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/411FtIQHiVL._AC_UL1074_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"cmjxfz","source_asin":"B0C3L9KHSD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-246696","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3L9KHSD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3L9KHSD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":246697,"name":"JoyJolt Small Ramekins 8 oz Oven Safe Bowls. White Embossed Porcelain Ceramic Ramekin Set of 4. Creme Brulee Ramekins, Souffle Cups, Custard Cups, Cha","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gpeUxlMaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cook Outside The Lines! As you know porcelain ramekins tend to follow a standard style. Vertical lines. But we decided to mix it up with 4 porcelain baking dishes with 4 cute embossed patterns! Unique dipping cups, crème brulee dishes, and mini pot pie baking dishes with fun joyful personality! What’s On The Menu? This individual bakeware is the perfect single baking dish for just about anything! Small casserole dish? Sure! Charcuterie board bowls and dip cups? Definitely. Personal puddings? Of course! These 8 oz bowls are 3.9” x 2.4” for personal portions of your favorite big dishes! Strong Porcelain Baking Ramekins: Durable for all temperatures and porcelain is non porous and won’t leach chemicals or bad tastes into food! They’re Freezer Safe, Fridge Safe, Microwave Safe and Oven Safe ramekins. Plus, suitable for airfryers, toaster ovens and broilers without breaking or chipping. Need a Different Size? Our patterned individual hot pot set also comes in 6 oz ramekins and 4oz bowls for making bigger or smaller bowls of dip, desserts and hot pot! Unique small ceramic bowls like these make cute gifts. Buy one set or collect them all! One for you, one for someone to cook for you! Unboxing Joy! This set of 4 individual serving baking dishes will arrive securely gift boxed and backed with our robust 12-Month Warranty. So contact us if anything goes wrong, ok? And whether you’re using them for individual casserole dishes or creme brulee set, we only have one rule – Cook for Joy!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gpeUxlMaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JoyJolt","source_asin":"B0BPCX9HB5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-246697","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPCX9HB5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPCX9HB5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
