window.products.push({"id":246754,"name":"Master Class MasterClass Professional Induction Ready 20cm Non-Stick Wok, Carbon Steel, Black, 20 cm (8 inch)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.92,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cM3K8MaKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Create sensational authentic oriental cuisine in this heavy-duty carbon steel induction wok from Master Class Professional. It’s so durable, you can even use metal utensils without scratching it! Designed to withstand the rigours of commercial kitchens, this wok is a smart choice for professional chefs and dedicated home cooks alike. It’s built to last for years, and boasts an outstanding nano-silica non-stick coating that’s 100% PFOA, PTFE and BPA free. The wok measures 20 cm (8”) wide, so it’s great for cooking up stir fries for a quick meal, or making sizzlingly good sides for a dinner party. Three-Layer Design and Riveted Handle for Awesome Durability This wok is constructed from three layers of premium-quality materials, for maximum durability. The outside is made of heavy-duty carbon steel, which helps protect the wok from bumps and scrapes. Its interior is coated with durable ceramic, for excellent heat retention. And finally, the inner non-stick coating provides years of fuss-free cooking performance. The added benefit of the riveted handle provides stability, so when you lift the wok, the handle won’t buckle under pressure – no matter how heavy the food contents are. Flat Base for Even Heat Distribution With this professional wok, you can enjoy that smoking ‘wok hei’ taste that comes from fast, high-temperature cooking. The flat base on the wok helps distribute the heat from your hob evenly, which is helped along by the excellent heat retention properties of ceramic. This means your stir fries are cooked thoroughly and to perfection. Impressive Non-Stick Performance – with No BPA The nano silica non-stick coating provides outstanding non-stick performance, while being 100% free from BPA, PFOA and PTFE. It’s completely food-safe and makes light work of frying and cleaning. Useful Information — Suitable for gas, solid plate, halogen, ceramic, radiant ring and induction hobs — Grill and oven safe to 220 degrees Celsius (428 degrees Fahrenheit) — Dishwasher safe — Comes with the Master Class 15 year guarantee Looking for a Bigger Wok? Master Class Professional is a range of kitchen tools and accessories designed for professional chefs, as well as home cooks who will only settle for the best. The collection also includes two larger versions of this wok. Why not add to your collection with the 24.5 cm (MCWOK26) or 30 cm (MCWOK30) varieties today? Set Contains: 1 x Master Class Professional Non-Stick Carbon Steel Induction-Safe Wok, 20 cm (8\")","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cM3K8MaKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Master Class","source_asin":"B01JIXJF8W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-246754","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01JIXJF8W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01JIXJF8W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
