window.products.push({"id":246870,"name":"Tatva Yog Dhoop Batti Sandalwood Sticks with Holder - Ahimsa (Pack of 2, 20 Sticks Per Pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Ph7J0aOLL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Cooling Properties Of Sandal Calm The Mind And Help You Rein In Your Emotions Better. A Calm Mind Is Ready To Receive Divine Messages From The Supreme Powers. Why Choose Tatva Yog Dhoop Sticks? If you are someone who is seeking high quality and premium dhoop, then this is an ideal product! Tatva Yog Dhoop sticks not only creates an inspirational and enthralling atmosphere but also inspires confidence, optimism and joyfulness  Whether you are using them for meditation or spiritual purpose or just for relaxing, these will lift up your mood within a few seconds, and create an amazing atmosphere all aroundBrings you the most soothing and refreshing fragrance sticks that are ideal for your home and workplaceFreshen up mind and body | Lighten up the mood | Relieves stress and anxiety | Improves sleep qualityKeep burning dhoop batti sticks on dhoop holder or stand and keep away from flammable articles. About brand ‘Tatva’ means element and ‘Yog’ is Union with God. It is believed that humans emanate from the Panch Tatva (Five Elements) namely Earth (physical existence), Water (emotions and creativity), Fire (mental power), Air (relationships) and Ether (higher self). It is the balance of these five elements that leads to Healing, Success and Self-empowerment. With a vision of connecting with God through the Panch Tatva, Tatva Yog has launched a wide range of spiritual products and Vedic Puja services. Tatva Yog is rooted in India’s rich spiritual heritage and aspires to facilitate the spiritual growth of customers by furnishing unique, handcrafted, and premium range of products and services. Come, dive deep into the mystical world of Indian spirituality and explore your heritage with inspired creations from Tatva Yog.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Ph7J0aOLL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tatva Yog","source_asin":"B088C1J8TR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-246870","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088C1J8TR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088C1J8TR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
