window.products.push({"id":246896,"name":"H HOMEWINS Travel Pillow 100% Pure Memory Foam Neck Pillow,Comfortable & Breathable Cover,Head Neck Support Pillow for Airplane,Car,Home,Office (Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y2AVR95aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM MEMORY FOAM - Provides high rebound and comforts, and the perfect balance of softness and support makes your neck and head much more easier Ergonomic Design: Our travel pillows are designed according to ergonomics that offers 365°support for your head and neck; The contoured shape at side avoids the discomfort of squeezing feeling for ears and leaves proper space for headphones; Stop your head from falling forward or leaning left or right. Every detail is designed for your travel comfort! EXPERIENCE LOVE AT FIRST NAP. Sleep peacefully all throughout your flight or journey. The perfect companion for those traveling in planes, cars, trains, buses, and more. It provides optimal neck and shoulder support to give you a more relaxing trip EASY CARE - Unisex color, popular and dirt-resistant. Velvet fabric for the cover, soft and skin-friendly. Detachable and washable, always keep your travel pillow clean and comfortable MAXIMIZE YOUR COMFORT AT HOME OR IN THE OFFICE. This is the perfect travel pillow even for those who don’t travel. The neck pillow is versatile and can be used for extra support when sleeping at night, relaxing at home or working in the office.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y2AVR95aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"H HOMEWINS","source_asin":"B08L4DBP1G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-246896","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L4DBP1G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L4DBP1G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
