window.products.push({"id":246905,"name":"Triple Amber 20 Stick Box - Rare Essence Incense","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41kcVUHYyZL._AC_.jpg","description":"It?s unequivocal. Triple Amber is a blend that?s pungent, tart, and penetrating, with some apparent yet slightly sour notes in its aroma you will either love or hate. Users seldom fall in a middle ground with this incense. Fortunately for you Rare Essence Triple Amber is beautifully balanced. It is a natural masala incense whose aroma lingers for hours. Masala incense, like this Triple Amber incense, is produced by creating a paste of natural ingredients (resins, barks, flowers, etc.) which are then rolled onto a bamboo stick. This paste process produces stronger aromas than simply dipping the stick into a chemical solution (a significantly cheaper process). Masala incense gives you a deeper, more satisfying and longer lasting fragrance. You?ll find it work the money. ? Triple Amber has a relaxing fragrance. It has a musky earthiness to its aroma. Triple Amber began as a fossil resin before it became part of the masala paste. Rare Essence Triple Amber has been carefully balanced for a distinctive aroma.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41kcVUHYyZL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rare Essence","source_asin":"B001B60Z34","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-246905","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001B60Z34","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001B60Z34","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
