window.products.push({"id":246919,"name":"Washable Room Darkening Cordless Roman Shades for Windows, Double Tone Color Jacquard Textured Woven Roman Blind for Living Room/Nursery/Bedroom 32\" W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":57.85,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RfbVtw7rL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"The Cordless Blackout Roman Shade is a timeless window covering option, which is attractive and durable with energy efficient properties. This beautiful Roman shade is suitable for formal or casual rooms where you need room darkening, added insulation, and a touch of elegance. It is easy to adjust by simply holding the bottom rail and then gently raising or lowering the shade by hand. This Cordless blackout Roman Shade is upgraded with the latest technique , which enable you take off the front fabric easily and wash it. For detail information, please follow the instruction. Select from either inside or outside mounts. An outside mount optimizes your view since the shades stack above the window, eliminating light gaps between the window parameter and your window treatment. Choose an inside mount if you are looking to achieve a customized look or have decorative molding you want to display. Example of choosing the right size: Inside Mount: Your window frame width is 30”, just choose 30\" wide shade for a proper inside mount(We will subtract 1/4\" from the width you selected to ensure a proper inside mount.)Outside Mount: Your window frame width is 30”, the best blind size will be 34-36”. In addition, request minimum installation depth is 2inch. Features： Mounting hardware and installation instructions includedTo adjust simply hold the bottom rail; raise or lower to desired heightWhite foaming back offers a uniform look from outside and energy savingShades can be installed inside or outside of the window frameProduct Care: Vacuum the shade and clean with a wet cloth first, damp second and then use a dry cloth to finish Packing: One blind with a fully protected bubble bag, hardware toolbox, and instruction sheet are included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RfbVtw7rL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Everyday Celebration","source_asin":"B08MD8BB3J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-246919","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MD8BB3J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MD8BB3J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
